osystem since 2021, maintaining a portfolio of interconnected tools that serve as foundational infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for the current Pallas maintenance contract (EC-0006-25, 220,914 ADA). The current contract is on track, with…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Milestone payments disclosed**\nPayment is tied to itemised milestones, not lump sum.\n\nAre payments tied to delivery milestones, or is this lump-sum upfront? Milestone payments mean the treasury releases funds as work lands. Lump-sum upfront pays in full before anything is delivered — much less leverage if the team underdelivers.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nPlease err on the side of \"UNCLEAR\" with explanation rather than confident-but-wrong.5a:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"milestone-payments-disclosed\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Milestone payments disclosed\"}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"label\":\"Milestone payments disclosed\",\"body\":\"Are payments tied to delivery milestones, or is this lump-sum upfront? Milestone payments mean the treasury releases funds as work lands. Lump-sum upfront pays in full before anything is delivered — much less leverage if the team underdelivers.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"c